      "extract": "Here we shall report on our work to construct knotlike vortices in the model intro- duced in [13]. By employing numerical algorithms in powerful computers we have been able to ﬁnd strong evidence for the existence of the unknot vortex. In addition we have found indications supporting the existence of a trefoil vortex (see ﬁgure 5). A trefoil is the simplest example of torus-knots, which are obtained by winding",
      "extractCut": true,
      "blocks": [
        "library/arxiv-hep-th-9610193v1/blocks/prose-page-003"
      ]
    },
