      "extract": "Several articles have been devoted for analyzing the general properties of the unknot vortex in the model (2) [12]. However, to our knowledge there have been no real attempts to ﬁnd an actual solution. This is due to the fact, that even in the simplest case of an unknot the separation of variables eliminates only one of the three space coordinates, leaving numerical methods as the sole alternative for ﬁnding a",
      "extractCut": true,
      "blocks": [
