      "extract": "to spontaneously broken Yang-Mills-Higgs theories where stable knotlike vortices can not be excluded by scaling arguments, should have interesting physical implications in particular to early universe cosmology. We wish to thank J.Hietarinta, T.K¨arki, A.P.Niemi, K.Palo, J.Pitk¨aranta, J.Rahola, D.Riska, R.Scharein, G.Sewell, O.Tirkkonen and J.Tulkki for helpful discussions and valuable suggestions. We are",
